WEBVTT

00:11:29.720 --> 00:11:36.200
values, canonized knowledge
and even religion,

00:11:37.840 --> 00:11:43.376
to maintain a hierarchical,
over-and-against power structure

00:11:43.400 --> 00:11:47.000
based on skin color,
against people of color.

00:11:51.640 --> 00:11:55.440
It is a culture

00:11:56.240 --> 00:12:02.520
where white people are seen
as necessary and friendly insiders,